1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,001
Hasten to glory and supremacy!

2
00:00:06,002 --> 00:00:11,000
Glorify the Creator of the sky!

3
00:00:11,100 --> 00:00:18,000
Rise the green flag,
carrying the written light,

4
00:00:18,001 --> 00:00:24,000
Repeat and say: God is great, my homeland!

5
00:00:24,001 --> 00:00:30,000
My homeland, live as the pride of Muslims!

6
00:00:30,003 --> 00:00:38,200
Long live the King!
For the flag, and the homeland!